  N("Common traps", "- **Adverse vs averse** (above): conditions are adverse; people are averse.\n- **Plausible doesn't mean true.** Scammers specialize in plausible stories.\n- **Volatile isn't only negative in markets.** Traders need some volatility to profit; it's the **unpredictability** that's dangerous.\n- **Inevitable** is strong. If there's any way around it, use *likely* instead.")
